[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 602.389, "timestamp": "00:10:02", "text": "是的，《Valerant》很好玩，但是，是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 604.949, "timestamp": "00:10:04", "text": "拿不到。感觉有点慢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 608.07, "timestamp": "00:10:08", "text": "因为我以前经常玩Apex英雄"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 611.43, "timestamp": "00:10:11", "text": "虽然我在这方面很差劲。我最终还是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 615.67, "timestamp": "00:10:15", "text": "也像安装 Valer 一样。这是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 617.35, "timestamp": "00:10:17", "text": "情况变得非常糟糕。我会连续报道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 619.19, "timestamp": "00:10:19", "text": "Valerant 曾经是一款不错的游戏，当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 621.19, "timestamp": "00:10:21", "text": "我喜欢这款游戏，我是游戏刚发售时就开始玩的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 623.829, "timestamp": "00:10:23", "text": "嗯，我玩过很多次。我觉得我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 625.91, "timestamp": "00:10:25", "text": "最后大概有四千个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 630.31, "timestamp": "00:10:30", "text": "自 2020 年以来，我已经玩了好几个小时的游戏了。我的天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 631.67, "timestamp": "00:10:31", "text": "那可真不少，你知道，就像那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 633.75, "timestamp": "00:10:33", "text": "我当时正在玩的游戏。但是后来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 635.99, "timestamp": "00:10:35", "text": "就像他们一直在添加一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 637.35, "timestamp": "00:10:37", "text": "到了后来，它就变成了……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 640.15, "timestamp": "00:10:40", "text": "他们称之为“有点过载”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 641.59, "timestamp": "00:10:41", "text": "它。但他们什么也不想做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 643.67, "timestamp": "00:10:43", "text": "关于它。所以，我就想，我其实不太明白。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 644.79, "timestamp": "00:10:44", "text": "想玩一款能让我获得……的游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 647.43, "timestamp": "00:10:47", "text": "就像能力过剩一样。所以，然后我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 649.11, "timestamp": "00:10:49", "text": "选择玩一款充满……的游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 651.07, "timestamp": "00:10:51", "text": "能力，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 653.11, "timestamp": "00:10:53", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 655.43, "timestamp": "00:10:55", "text": "所以现在，没错，这就是我玩的游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 658.55, "timestamp": "00:10:58", "text": "很多和流媒体。"}]